OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over operator at #5m
OL,4,Aempty market hall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA market that has been left empty after
OL,7,Fa #5m refit faces further delays before
OL,8,Freopening due to concerns over the
OL,9,Foperator.
OL,11,FWork on the Market Hall project in
OL,12,FNewton Abbot was completed in June but
OL,13,Fthe building has sat empty and now
OL,14,FTeignbridge District Council says it is
OL,15,F"not satisfied" with the firm that was
OL,16,Flined up to be in charge of the
OL,17,Fbuilding.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
