OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over operator at #5m
OL,4,Aempty market hall
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said after "extensive discussions,
OL,7,Fchecks and assessments" it was not
OL,8,Fconvinced "the proposed arrangements
OL,9,Fwould provide a secure long-term future
OL,10,Ffor the Market Hall".
OL,12,FThe council said all options were now
OL,13,Fopen and could not say when the market,
OL,14,Fwhich it described as "the jewel in
OL,15,FNewton Abbot's crown" might open.
